WEBVTT

00:00:05.447 --> 00:00:08.348
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.117 --> 00:00:11.986
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.986 --> 00:00:14.045
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.889 --> 00:00:19.019
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.595 --> 00:00:23.431
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.431 --> 00:00:25.558
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.334 --> 00:00:30.361
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:32.073 --> 00:00:34.843
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.843 --> 00:00:37.471
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.745 --> 00:00:41.340
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.784 --> 00:00:47.448
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.456 --> 00:00:49.958
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.958 --> 00:00:53.155
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.996 --> 00:00:57.165
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.165 --> 00:01:01.226
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.469 --> 00:01:06.099
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.876 --> 00:01:09.366
Let's go!

00:01:12.647 --> 00:01:16.014
WHEN YOU WISH UPON
A FLOWER

00:01:20.555 --> 00:01:22.113
This is Harumi. This is Harumi.

00:01:22.557 --> 00:01:25.754
The destroyer Soyokaze is currently
headed on its scheduled route.

00:01:26.528 --> 00:01:27.629
From this time forward...

00:01:27.629 --> 00:01:31.087
...I will be making regular
reports on Justy Ueki Tylor.

00:01:31.466 --> 00:01:31.932
Hi!

00:01:33.201 --> 00:01:34.566
C- Captain!

00:01:34.736 --> 00:01:36.471
Doing your spy stuff here?

00:01:36.471 --> 00:01:39.173
Uh, yes. Gravitational
interference in this area...

00:01:39.173 --> 00:01:41.209
...is making a direct
transmission impossible...

00:01:41.209 --> 00:01:42.744
...so I'm recording
my report this time.

00:01:42.744 --> 00:01:46.612
I see. But you
shouldn't do it here.

00:01:47.215 --> 00:01:50.241
Find a safer place
or someone'll see you.

00:01:50.885 --> 00:01:51.613
Yes, sir.

00:01:51.953 --> 00:01:53.443
See you! And be careful.

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:03.561
Justy Ueki Tylor... Your mind
remains a mystery to me.

00:02:03.831 --> 00:02:08.268
However... I sense something
in you I can't put into words.

00:02:17.946 --> 00:02:19.004
Forget the formalities.

00:02:19.647 --> 00:02:22.275
Tell me what you've
learned about Tylor.

00:02:22.984 --> 00:02:24.212
As you wish.

00:02:24.986 --> 00:02:28.945
Justy Ueki Tylor... Your mind
remains a mystery to me.

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:33.488
However... I sense something
in you I can't put into words.

00:02:34.295 --> 00:02:35.353
Is that all?

00:02:35.496 --> 00:02:37.565
Yes. Forgive me, Highness.

00:02:37.565 --> 00:02:38.463
I see.

00:02:39.634 --> 00:02:43.126
Tylor... How I wish
I could see his face.

00:02:46.674 --> 00:02:52.306
Can I assume there are
no objections in this matter?

00:02:53.615 --> 00:02:57.984
Then I will conclude that
the decision is unanimous.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.525
WHAT?!

00:03:07.996 --> 00:03:09.463
You have your orders.

00:03:10.498 --> 00:03:11.795
Wait, please!

00:03:14.636 --> 00:03:18.265
Hey, Mr. Katori, what do
these new orders mean?

00:03:18.339 --> 00:03:20.637
Well, sir... They mean...

00:03:20.708 --> 00:03:22.437
I'll answer this.

00:03:23.044 --> 00:03:26.775
Are you listening, Captain?
The Soyokaze...

00:03:27.715 --> 00:03:29.979
The Soyokaze has been!

00:03:30.718 --> 00:03:33.653
We... We've been downgraded?!
You're sure?!

00:03:33.855 --> 00:03:35.152
It's definite.

00:03:35.323 --> 00:03:37.791
But why would they
do that, Mr. Kojiro?

00:03:38.059 --> 00:03:40.789
There's only one reason
I can think of!

00:03:41.062 --> 00:03:43.464
It's because of the
captain, isn't it?!

00:03:43.464 --> 00:03:44.954
I agree.

00:03:46.401 --> 00:03:47.568
No way!

00:03:47.568 --> 00:03:50.059
They canвЂ™t just send us
off to the wilderness!

00:03:50.672 --> 00:03:51.866
Right, Skipper?!

00:03:54.075 --> 00:03:58.273
Nothing's worse than
humiliation for a Marine.

00:03:59.914 --> 00:04:03.577
Doctor, do you think a
man like Captain Tylor...

00:04:04.085 --> 00:04:06.747
...would even consider getting
downgraded humiliating?

00:04:07.021 --> 00:04:10.718
Good question.
But he is a soldier.

00:04:11.092 --> 00:04:15.392
A soldier would sooner die than
get locked out from promotion.

00:04:18.099 --> 00:04:20.624
At least,
that's usually the case.

00:04:20.768 --> 00:04:25.705
But the captain doesn't seem
like that sort of person to me.

00:04:25.807 --> 00:04:28.901
Well... Who's to say?

00:04:35.283 --> 00:04:37.114
Do you understand, Captain?!

00:04:37.418 --> 00:04:39.318
Downgraded!
We've been downgraded!

00:04:39.387 --> 00:04:42.845
It means that the
senior staff have decided...

00:04:42.924 --> 00:04:46.155
...that the Soyokaze is
strategically worthless!

00:04:46.461 --> 00:04:47.223
But why?

00:04:47.528 --> 00:04:48.930
How can you ask why?!

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:51.831
There's only one reason
we've been downgraded!

00:04:52.867 --> 00:04:54.335
One reason?

00:04:54.335 --> 00:04:57.065
To be downgraded is to be
dropped to a lower status...

00:04:57.138 --> 00:05:00.938
...from where you currently serve.
It's the opposite of promotion.

00:05:01.142 --> 00:05:02.109
Do you understand?!

00:05:03.311 --> 00:05:04.744
Dropped, huh?

00:05:08.382 --> 00:05:09.406
This drop...

00:05:09.817 --> 00:05:10.545
...I'll stop!

00:05:13.921 --> 00:05:16.185
Captain, would you
please cut that out?!

00:05:16.257 --> 00:05:19.090
Don't you understand that
your irresponsibility...

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:21.458
...and total inability to
judge situations...

00:05:21.529 --> 00:05:24.293
...has gotten the Soyokaze
such a horrible review?

00:05:24.499 --> 00:05:26.091
The commander's right!

00:05:26.501 --> 00:05:28.765
Captain! Are you just gonna...

00:05:28.836 --> 00:05:30.770
...go off to the galactic
boonies without a fight?!

00:05:30.938 --> 00:05:32.440
I wasn't planning to...

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:34.271
Come on! Just give us
a straight answer!

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:38.312
You must have some idea
about how to fight this!

00:05:38.312 --> 00:05:41.549
Guys, guys, please.
Let's not get excited, okay?

00:05:41.549 --> 00:05:45.007
Captain, there is only one thing
we can do in this situation.

00:05:45.186 --> 00:05:46.813
Oh? What should we do?

00:05:47.188 --> 00:05:52.319
Apply article 38 of the United
Planets Space Force regulations.

00:05:52.627 --> 00:05:53.685
Lieutenant Yamamoto!

00:05:54.162 --> 00:05:58.499
I know, Commander. But if we don't
take emergency measures now!

00:05:58.499 --> 00:06:01.798
Hold it! What're you
two talking about?!

00:06:01.869 --> 00:06:03.837
You mind letting
us in on the secret?

00:06:04.105 --> 00:06:09.177
Article 38 allows you to request
a change in orders given to you.

00:06:09.177 --> 00:06:11.805
Request a change in orders?

00:06:11.879 --> 00:06:14.780
In other words, if you
follow the proper procedure...

00:06:14.849 --> 00:06:18.615
...you can request that a
superior's orders be rescinded.

00:06:18.719 --> 00:06:19.981
Really?!

00:06:20.054 --> 00:06:22.249
However, there are conditions.

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:25.459
First, only applications made
directly in person will be reviewed.

00:06:26.194 --> 00:06:31.359
Second, it must be submitted within
48 hours of receiving the orders.

00:06:31.866 --> 00:06:32.764
Lieutenant Katori?

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:36.871
Leave this to me! I'll
have us there in 43 hours!

00:06:36.871 --> 00:06:40.204
All right, all right!
5 hours is more than we need!

00:06:40.541 --> 00:06:42.771
Man, I shouldn't
have gotten so worried.

00:06:42.844 --> 00:06:45.176
Now that that's settled, let's
have a pre-victory celebration!

00:06:45.246 --> 00:06:47.214
All right!
Get ready to party!

00:06:47.582 --> 00:06:49.675
People, it's too
soon to celebrate!

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:53.117
There is one more vital
condition to article 38.

00:06:54.789 --> 00:06:59.192
The only man...
The only man qualified...

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:02.855
...to enter a request to have
any orders changed is the!

00:07:03.030 --> 00:07:05.521
Is the highest ranking
officer on board.

00:07:06.934 --> 00:07:08.868
Th-th-th-th-the highest...

00:07:08.936 --> 00:07:09.868
...ranking...

00:07:09.971 --> 00:07:10.630
...offi...

00:07:10.938 --> 00:07:11.529
...cer?!

00:07:13.507 --> 00:07:16.408
Huh? What's with you guys?

00:07:23.918 --> 00:07:24.646
Well?

00:07:49.677 --> 00:07:52.908
It's great to sit in
the captain's chair...

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:55.574
...but it's nice to be on
the ground once in a while.

00:07:56.150 --> 00:07:59.415
Come on, Yuriko.
We've got plenty of time.

00:07:59.754 --> 00:08:01.915
Why don't we go somewhere,
relax, and have a drink?

00:08:01.989 --> 00:08:05.254
Once we've filed the application,
you can have your drink.

00:08:05.626 --> 00:08:06.615
By yourself.

00:08:07.295 --> 00:08:08.728
I meant the three of us.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:15.628
Nothing to worry about.
We'll make it in plenty of time.

00:08:16.103 --> 00:08:17.593
See, like I said.

00:08:17.805 --> 00:08:21.263
Quit hurrying and relax.
Just relax.

00:08:22.977 --> 00:08:23.944
Hey, that's...

00:08:27.348 --> 00:08:29.475
What? Captain! Wait!

00:08:31.018 --> 00:08:32.781
Captain, where are you going?!

00:08:35.356 --> 00:08:36.118
Captain?

00:08:36.357 --> 00:08:37.585
Captain!

00:08:38.659 --> 00:08:41.628
Mr. Kojiro, isn't that enough?

00:08:42.863 --> 00:08:45.229
You've been polishing it all day.

00:08:45.366 --> 00:08:49.132
Leave me alone! I relax
best when I'm doing this!

00:08:56.877 --> 00:08:59.072
Please, Captain...

00:09:06.654 --> 00:09:07.916
He will make it.

00:09:08.723 --> 00:09:10.190
He won't make it.

00:09:11.392 --> 00:09:12.484
He will make it.

00:09:13.361 --> 00:09:14.623
He won't make it.

00:09:18.399 --> 00:09:20.301
Well?! Keep going!

00:09:20.301 --> 00:09:21.097
Yes, sir!

00:09:21.335 --> 00:09:23.667
He will make it.
He won't make it.

00:09:24.405 --> 00:09:26.839
He will make it.
He won't make it.

00:09:27.074 --> 00:09:29.406
He will make it.
He won't make it.

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:31.805
He will make it.
He won't make it.

00:09:32.079 --> 00:09:34.206
He will make it.
He won't make it.

00:09:34.415 --> 00:09:36.576
He will make it!
He won't make it!

00:09:36.751 --> 00:09:38.981
He will make it!
He won't make it!

00:09:39.086 --> 00:09:40.951
He will make it!
He won't make it!

00:09:45.092 --> 00:09:47.287
Lieutenant, don't worry.

00:09:48.396 --> 00:09:50.023
The captain's a soldier, too.

00:09:50.097 --> 00:09:53.692
I don't think he'd just
accept being downgraded.

00:09:53.768 --> 00:09:57.033
Besides, we don't have to
worry with Yuriko with him.

00:09:57.104 --> 00:09:59.231
She'll keep him in line.

00:09:59.306 --> 00:10:02.833
And Harumi went along in
case there's an accident.

00:10:03.144 --> 00:10:04.372
There's nothing to worry about.

00:10:06.414 --> 00:10:08.882
Right... I believe you.

00:10:11.719 --> 00:10:12.708
I'll get us some tea.

00:10:18.325 --> 00:10:22.762
Four hours to go. Don't let
us down, Cmdr. Yuriko Star.

00:10:33.474 --> 00:10:34.498
Oh, Yuriko.

00:10:34.775 --> 00:10:36.675
What do you
think you're doing?!

00:10:37.144 --> 00:10:40.739
Didn't I tell you not to
go wandering off like that?!

00:10:41.082 --> 00:10:44.882
Yeah, but you wouldn't believe
who I ran into just now.

00:10:45.152 --> 00:10:48.485
Look, sir. It's Commander Star.
Do you recognize her?

00:10:50.791 --> 00:10:51.849
Admiral Hanner!

00:10:53.794 --> 00:10:57.031
See? It's been a while,
hasn't it, Yuriko?

00:10:57.031 --> 00:10:59.261
Admiral Hanner,
how are you feeling, sir?

00:11:05.172 --> 00:11:08.539
Well, sir? It's specially
imported refined green tea.

00:11:08.976 --> 00:11:10.204
Doesn't it smell wonderful?

00:11:10.845 --> 00:11:13.075
Ah, yes. It does.

00:11:14.682 --> 00:11:15.614
Look!

00:11:15.816 --> 00:11:18.717
That's a sign of good luck!
The tea stalk's...

00:11:19.753 --> 00:11:21.482
No, wait!

00:11:21.822 --> 00:11:22.720
OW!

00:11:25.793 --> 00:11:26.657
Lieutenant?

00:11:26.827 --> 00:11:29.728
He will make it.
He won't make it.

00:11:30.164 --> 00:11:33.964
He will make it.
He won't make it...

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:49.047
He will make it.
He won't make it.

00:11:49.216 --> 00:11:51.309
He will make it!
He won't make it!

00:11:51.552 --> 00:11:53.543
He will make it!
He won't make it!

00:12:32.193 --> 00:12:32.887
I found out.

00:12:33.594 --> 00:12:36.791
His old
home was condemned...

00:12:36.864 --> 00:12:39.355
...so they moved him into
this retirement home for now.

00:12:41.569 --> 00:12:45.869
I see. Admiral Hanner,
Emi and Yumi...

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:47.805
...are doing just
fine on the Soyokaze...

00:12:47.875 --> 00:12:49.433
...so please don't
worry about them.

00:12:52.947 --> 00:12:54.209
Captain, we'd better go.

00:12:54.281 --> 00:12:57.773
I know! Why don't we
take a walk, Admiral?

00:12:58.786 --> 00:13:03.223
I can tell you all about what's
happened on the Soyokaze.

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:04.917
Uh, Captain!

00:13:07.261 --> 00:13:10.128
Commander, we still
have plenty of time.

00:13:10.631 --> 00:13:12.758
I'm sure the
captain realizes that.

00:13:12.833 --> 00:13:17.896
Harumi, you still really don't
understand the captain at all.

00:13:18.639 --> 00:13:21.005
And you're saying you do?

00:13:21.242 --> 00:13:21.833
Yes.

00:13:22.309 --> 00:13:26.871
Besides having no ability
to appreciate a situation...

00:13:26.947 --> 00:13:29.177
...the captain hasn't one
iota of responsibility.

00:13:29.316 --> 00:13:31.477
He's totally oblivious!

00:13:36.657 --> 00:13:37.453
Oh, great!

00:13:45.332 --> 00:13:47.493
Mr. Katori! Another cup!

00:13:47.668 --> 00:13:48.600
A-Aye, sir.

00:13:48.836 --> 00:13:50.463
That was your fourth one.

00:13:50.671 --> 00:13:52.434
I don't care! Give me another!

00:13:54.975 --> 00:13:57.500
He will make it!
He won't make it!

00:13:57.911 --> 00:14:00.641
He will make it!
He won't!!!

00:14:03.684 --> 00:14:05.618
Hey! Get another one!

00:14:05.853 --> 00:14:08.913
That was the last one.

00:14:08.989 --> 00:14:10.286
WHAT?!

00:14:10.858 --> 00:14:12.257
You looked everywhere?!

00:14:12.359 --> 00:14:15.192
I practically turned
the ship upside-down!

00:14:15.362 --> 00:14:17.057
There just aren't any others!

00:14:17.364 --> 00:14:19.127
Son of a!

00:14:20.367 --> 00:14:22.392
He won't make it...

00:14:29.376 --> 00:14:32.345
Captain! Captain Tylor!

00:14:33.981 --> 00:14:35.005
Captain!

00:14:40.387 --> 00:14:41.115
Find him?

00:14:41.355 --> 00:14:42.686
No, not anywhere.

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:46.255
Wonderful! Let's walk
around one more time.

00:14:46.393 --> 00:14:47.018
Right.

00:15:39.079 --> 00:15:40.808
I see what you mean.

00:15:41.081 --> 00:15:44.812
He definitely needs a trip
into the neuro-cleanser.

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:54.722
Another cup!

00:15:54.962 --> 00:15:56.930
Lieutenant, stop it, please!

00:15:57.798 --> 00:15:59.732
I won't give up!
I'll keep drinking...

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:01.825
...until I get one with a
tea stalk floating upright!

00:16:05.773 --> 00:16:07.070
Another cup!

00:16:24.491 --> 00:16:29.758
And BOOM! That Raalgon fleet
was blown to space dust!

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:30.592
Captain!

00:16:31.999 --> 00:16:33.159
What are you doing?!

00:16:33.534 --> 00:16:36.025
What do you mean? Having fun
talking with the admiral.

00:16:36.103 --> 00:16:37.127
Right, sir?

00:16:58.859 --> 00:17:00.292
Ow...

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:08.898
I know how much you like
seeing the admiral! So do I!

00:17:09.102 --> 00:17:11.036
But... But!

00:17:15.876 --> 00:17:16.706
Commander...

00:17:18.812 --> 00:17:22.873
Can't you... Can't you just think
about the crews' feelings for once?!

00:17:23.116 --> 00:17:27.212
They're all counting on you to get
the downgrading order reversed!

00:17:27.554 --> 00:17:28.919
I can't believe...

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:32.290
I can't believe anyone
could be this irresponsible!

00:17:33.527 --> 00:17:36.655
Admiral, the truth is that
the Force has downgraded us...

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:39.824
...and reassigned the ship
to the galactic frontier.

00:17:40.267 --> 00:17:45.034
We came to this planet to try
and get the order rescinded.

00:17:45.105 --> 00:17:47.164
The application deadline
is almost here.

00:17:47.574 --> 00:17:51.635
Please, let us go!
I beg of you!

00:17:51.912 --> 00:17:52.901
Yuriko...

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:13.491
Admiral, are you
telling me to go?

00:18:16.103 --> 00:18:16.933
Admiral!

00:18:19.473 --> 00:18:21.168
Understood, Admiral, sir!

00:18:21.241 --> 00:18:23.801
I'll come back and
finish our talk later.

00:18:24.177 --> 00:18:24.871
I promise!

00:18:40.627 --> 00:18:43.330
Yuriko, aren't you
going a little too fast?

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:45.457
Only ten minutes left!
We have to hurry!

00:19:16.663 --> 00:19:17.652
They're back!

00:19:42.689 --> 00:19:44.247
We're home, folks!

00:19:48.362 --> 00:19:49.351
We're saved!

00:19:53.033 --> 00:19:54.864
Welcome back, Captain!

00:19:55.035 --> 00:19:57.663
Yeah, well,
I'm really sorry, everyone.

00:19:58.338 --> 00:20:00.272
You're... sorry?

00:20:00.707 --> 00:20:03.642
We got sidetracked
and missed the deadline.

00:20:08.715 --> 00:20:11.445
C-C-Commander Star!
How could he have?!

00:20:11.685 --> 00:20:14.313
I'm sorry. It's all my fault.

00:20:14.755 --> 00:20:17.223
Oh... no...

00:20:20.293 --> 00:20:24.423
Oh, yeah. I've got great
news for Emi and Yumi.

00:20:24.731 --> 00:20:25.265
Come with me.

00:20:25.265 --> 00:20:27.165
Oh? What is it, Mr. Tylor?

00:20:27.534 --> 00:20:31.334
Well, I ran into your
dad down on the planet.

00:20:31.571 --> 00:20:32.606
Our father?!

00:20:32.606 --> 00:20:33.595
Really?!

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:39.374
Since no application was
filed to reverse the orders...

00:20:39.713 --> 00:20:43.513
...the Soyokaze...
No, TYLOR is hereby demoted!

00:20:45.052 --> 00:20:48.180
CASE CLOSED

00:20:48.755 --> 00:20:49.653
God has...

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:52.115
God has forsaken us!

00:21:06.373 --> 00:21:08.034
Why? I don't get it.

00:21:08.241 --> 00:21:11.506
Surely the captain couldn't
have wanted the demotion.

00:21:16.083 --> 00:21:18.415
How can he be so happy?

00:21:22.756 --> 00:21:23.723
I don't understand.

00:21:30.731 --> 00:21:31.789
I just don't understand.

00:21:32.799 --> 00:21:34.858
There are still
questions to be answered.

00:21:35.502 --> 00:21:39.268
However, perhaps...
Just perhaps...

00:21:39.439 --> 00:21:42.602
...I may have some understanding
of Tylor's true nature.

00:21:43.143 --> 00:21:44.235
I see.

00:21:45.145 --> 00:21:47.045
I await your next report.

00:21:47.380 --> 00:21:48.176
Aye, sir.

00:22:01.828 --> 00:22:06.265
Attention all hands. We are
now entering demotion sector S-4.

00:22:06.333 --> 00:22:10.133
I repeat, we are entering
demotion sector S-4.

